    note: "The narrowest and the best-evidenced. In TRITON2, 115 men with a BRCA alteration had a confirmed objective response rate of 43.5% by independent review (27 of 62 with measurable disease) and a confirmed PSA response rate of 54.8% (63 of 115); response rates were similar whether the alteration was germline or somatic and whether it was BRCA1 or BRCA2, though PSA responses were commoner with BRCA2 (Abida 2020).",
