    findings: ["Independent association with shorter progression-free survival on both assays (hazard ratios 1.9 and 2.4).", "Independent association with shorter overall survival (hazard ratios 4.2 and 3.5).", "Confirmed PSA responses in 0 to 11% of AR-V7-positive men.", "Agreement between the two assays 82%."],
